cff-version: 1.2.0
title: |
  Open play: a longitudinal dataset of multi-platform video game digital trace data and psychological measures
version: 1.2.7
license: CC0-1.0
type: dataset
abstract: |
  Open Play is a longitudinal dataset combining multi-platform video game digital trace data with psychological assessments from participants in the US and UK. It includes behavioral telemetry from Xbox, Nintendo Switch, Steam, iOS, and Android, and daily/biweekly survey measures of wellbeing, sleep, stress, and basic psychological needs, and task-based measures of attention control.
message: |
  If you use this data, please cite it as indicated.
